{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40044","headline":"晓 · 徐夤","name":"晓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"水尽铜龙滴渐微，景阳锺动梦魂飞。\n潼关鸡唱促归骑，金殿烛残求御衣。\n窗下寒机犹自织，梁间栖燕欲双飞。\n羲和晴耸扶桑辔，借与寰瀛看早晖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐夤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40044.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40044","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}